OL,3,GNEWSAEurope 'not big enough' for
OL,4,ACherries, jokes fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBournemouth football fans are
OL,7,Fcelebrating the team's latest success
OL,8,Fin European competition.
OL,10,FThe Cherries beat Sparta Prague 3-1,
OL,11,Fwhich keeps the club's 100% record in
OL,12,Fthe Europa League this season and puts
OL,13,FBournemouth top of the table and on
OL,14,Fcourse for the next stage.
OL,16,FAfter the match in Prague, fan Chris
OL,17,FLatchem joked: "Genuinely, I feel like
OL,18,Fmaybe Europe's not big enough for
OL,19,FBournemouth these days."
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
