OL,5,
OL,6,FTom Latchem added: "We may be getting
OL,7,Ftoo ahead of ourselves, but put it this
OL,8,Fway, I have already booked a hotel for
OL,9,Fme, him and my brother in Frankfurt
OL,10,F[for the final]."
